            "review_title": "Review at Cajun Boil",
            "review_text": "Jerry D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam356 contributions\n0\nFirst timers\nJul 2026 • Family\nTook wife and son for their first Cajun seafood experience. I ordered French fries.\n They ordered the 749,000 combo spicy #1. Had crab legs, crawfish, corn, mussels, clams, sausage.\nThe sausage ( not great) was local not Lousiana Andouie. Was told the crawfish is from Canada.. Guessing the crag legs and crawfish were frozen as they said it tasted old. They should have ordered spicy #2.\nRead more\nWritten July 13, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
